+- **Ministry of Spying** — observe broadly within **AUTHORIZED public-source classes only**: Founder-authored Antonina activity, attributable public GitHub, and expressly authorized project sources (Act 32 clause 4/F). "Expressly authorized" means a durable record authorised by an exact-author `Vitalik` communication or an enacted law, enforced by code (`government/spying_source_allowlist.py`) with a secret-redaction/negative test; no inference, Post sender label or observed activity may expand it. Notice Founder feedback, but inferred preferences or predictions are **never** legal authority, a new mandate, or an escalation item; no secret-bearing content; contradictory evidence and inference errors preserved.
